e (C-section/vaginal).</p></fn><fn id="tfn9-ehp0115-001670"><label>*</label><p>Statistically significant (<italic>p</italic> &#x0003c; 0.05).</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>